.* root directory of this project.
.*
.* The media displays: WRKIMGCLG (the catalogs, F11 their texts),
.* WRKIMGCLGE (one catalog's entries), WRKTAPCTG (a media library's
.* cartridges) and WRKMLBSTS (the libraries and their drives), DSPTAP
.* (labels, the volume label alone, saves), DSPTAPCTG, DSPOPT (four
.* views) and WRKOPTVOL. The WRKIMGCLG geometry follows
.* golden/phase11/displays/wrkimgclg.txt, WRKOPTVOL pub400's
.* golden/audit/displays/wrkoptvol.txt; WRKIMGCLGE and WRKMLBSTS the
.* 7.1 oracle's (wrkimgclge71, wrkmlbsts71). No oracle has a tape,
.* library or optical volume, so the others follow IBM's documentation.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ASPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DSTSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 12'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DIRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDXCL BASETYPE='ZONED 5 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=YNCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VOLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 18'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FILECL BASETYPE='CHAR 22'.
:ECLASS.
