:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIMGCLG KEYL=CLGKEYS HELP=WRKIMGCLG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Image Catalogs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CLGS EXTACT=YES.(No image catalogs)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='CMD ?CRTIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DLTIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?LODIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.) OPTION(*LOAD)'.8=Load
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.) OPTION(*UNLOAD)'.9=Unload
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?VFYIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.10=Verify
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 12'.12=Work with entries
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CLG USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES.Image Catalog
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGASP USAGE=OUTPUT.ASP Threshold
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Device Status
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIMGCLG2 KEYL=CLGKEYS HELP=WRKIMGCLG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Image Catalogs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CLGS EXTACT=YES.(No image catalogs)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='CMD ?CRTIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DLTIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?LODIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.) OPTION(*LOAD)'.8=Load
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.) OPTION(*UNLOAD)'.9=Unload
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?VFYIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.10=Verify
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 12'.12=Work with entries
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CLG USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES.Image Catalog
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIMGCLGE KEYL=ENTKEYS HELP=WRKIMGCLGE ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Image Catalog Entries
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=14.
:DATACOL WIDTH=41.
:DATAI VAR=CLG USAGE=OUTPUT.Catalog
:DATAI VAR=CLGTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:DATAI VAR=CLGDIR USAGE=OUTPUT.Directory
:DATACOL WIDTH=14.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=CLGSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=CLGDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=ENTS EXTACT=YES.(No entries)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='CMD ?ADDIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.)'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?CHGIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.)'.2=Change    
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD RMVIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.)'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.) OPTION(*MOUNT)'.6=Mount
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.) OPTION(*LOAD)'.8=Load
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.) OPTION(*UNLOAD)'.9=Unload 
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 10'.10=Initialize volume
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 12'.12=Work with volume
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=IDX USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES.Index
:LISTCOL VAR=ENTSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=IMGFILE USAGE=OUTPUT.Image File Name
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKTAPCTG KEYL=CTGKEYS HELP=WRKTAPCTG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Tape Cartridges
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAI VAR=MLBDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Library device
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CTGS.(No cartridges)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?ADDTAPCTG DEV(&MLBDEV.) CTG(&CTG.)'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGTAPCTG DEV(&MLBDEV.) CTG(&CTG.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD RMVTAPCTG DEV(&MLBDEV.) CTG(&CTG.)'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPTAPCTG DEV(&MLBDEV.) CTG(&CTG.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 6'.6=Mount
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Demount
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CTG USAGE=OUTPUT.Cartridge ID
:LISTCOL VAR=CTGVOL USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume ID
:LISTCOL VAR=CTGCGY USAGE=OUTPUT.Category
:LISTCOL VAR=CTGSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=CTGLOC USAGE=OUTPUT.Location
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKMLBSTS KEYL=MLBKEYS HELP=WRKMLBSTS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Media Library Status
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSRCS.(No media libraries)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD VRYCFG CFGOBJ(&RSRCLIB.) CFGTYPE(*DEV) STATUS(*ON)'.1=Vary on
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD VRYCFG CFGOBJ(&RSRCLIB.) CFGTYPE(*DEV) STATUS(*OFF)'.2=Vary off
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='RETURN 3'.3=Reset resource    
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4'.4=Allocate resource
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Allocate unprotected
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 6'.6=Deallocate resource
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(&RSRCLIB.)'.8=Work with description
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSRC USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=7. Device/    Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSRCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=23.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=ALLOC USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=46.Allocation
:LISTCOL VAR=RSRCJOB USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=69.Job         name       
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPTAP KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPTAP ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Tape Volume Information
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=VOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume identifier
:DATAI VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT.Owner identifier
:DATAI VAR=VOLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume type
:DATAI VAR=CODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Code
:DATAI VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=FILES SCROLL=YES.(No files on the volume)
:LISTCOL VAR=FSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.File Sequence
:LISTCOL VAR=FLABEL USAGE=OUTPUT.File Label
:LISTCOL VAR=FVSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume Sequence
:LISTCOL VAR=FCRT USAGE=OUTPUT.Creation Date
:LISTCOL VAR=FEXP USAGE=OUTPUT.Expiration Date
:LISTCOL VAR=FBLK USAGE=OUTPUT.Blocks
:LISTCOL VAR=FEND USAGE=OUTPUT.Ends
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPTAPVOL KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPTAP ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Tape Volume Information
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=VOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume identifier
:DATAI VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT.Owner identifier
:DATAI VAR=VOLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume type
:DATAI VAR=CODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Code
:DATAI VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPTAPSAV KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPTAPSAV ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Tape Save Information
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=VOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume identifier
:DATAI VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS SCROLL=YES.(No saved objects on the volume)
:LISTCOL VAR=OSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=4.Seq
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=OLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OATTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Attribute
:LISTCOL VAR=OSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=10.Size
:LISTCOL VAR=OTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPTAPCTG KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPTAPCTG ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Tape Cartridge
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=MLBDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Library device
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=CTG USAGE=OUTPUT.Cartridge ID
:DATAI VAR=CTGVOL USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume ID
:DATAI VAR=CTGCGY USAGE=OUTPUT.Category
:DATAI VAR=CTGSYS USAGE=OUTPUT.Category system
:DATAI VAR=CTGSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=CTGLOC USAGE=OUTPUT.Location
:DATAI VAR=CTGHOME USAGE=OUTPUT.Home location
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOPTVOL KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPOPT ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Optical Volume Attributes
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=IND.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=VOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume identifier
:DATAI VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Optical device
:DATAI VAR=VOLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume type
:DATAI VAR=MEDTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Media type
:DATAI VAR=MEDFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Media format
:DATAI VAR=VOLTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:DATAI VAR=WRTPTC USAGE=OUTPUT.Write protected
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=CRTDTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Created
:DATAI VAR=CHGDTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Last changed
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=VOLCAP USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume capacity (bytes)
:DATAI VAR=VOLUSED USAGE=OUTPUT.Space used (bytes)
:DATAI VAR=VOLFREE USAGE=OUTPUT.Space available (bytes)
:DATAI VAR=BLKSIZ USAGE=OUTPUT.Block size
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=VOLSET USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume set
:DATAI VAR=SETSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Volumes in set
:DATAI VAR=SETSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Sequence in set
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOPTDIR KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPOPT ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Optical Directory Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=VOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume identifier
:DATAI VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Optical device
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=DIRS SCROLL=YES.(No directories)
:LISTCOL VAR=DPATH USAGE=OUTPUT.Directory
:LISTCOL VAR=DFILES USAGE=OUTPUT.Files
:LISTCOL VAR=DDIRS USAGE=OUTPUT.Directories
:LISTCOL VAR=DBYTES USAGE=OUTPUT.Bytes
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOPTFIL KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPOPT ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Optical File Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=VOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume identifier
:DATAI VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Optical device
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OFILES SCROLL=YES.(No files)
:LISTCOL VAR=FPATH USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:LISTCOL VAR=FSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Size
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOPTSAV KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPOPT ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Optical Save Information
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=VOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume identifier
:DATAI VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Optical device
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OSAVS SCROLL=YES.(No saved objects on the volume)
:LISTCOL VAR=OFILE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=12.Optical File
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=OLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=10.Size
:LISTCOL VAR=OTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKOPTVOL KEYL=VOLKEYS HELP=WRKOPTVOL ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Optical Volumes
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=WDEV USAGE=INOUT.Device
:DATAI VAR=CSI USAGE=OUTPUT.Side information
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=VOLS SCROLL=YES EXTACT=YES.(No optical volumes)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='CMD ?ADDOPTCTG ?-VOL(&VOL.)'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 102'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 103'.3=Copy
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 104'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DSPOPT VOL(&VOL.) DEV(&DEV.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD WRKLNK OBJ(''/QOPT/&VOL.'')'.8=Work with directories
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?INZOPT VOL(&VOL.) DEV(&DEV.)'.10=Initialize
:LISTACT OPTION=11 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD WRKLNK OBJ(''/QOPT/&VOL./*'')'.11=Work with object links
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?DUPOPT FROMVOL(&VOL.) FROMDEV(&DEV.)'.12=Duplicate ...
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=VOL USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=7 EXTACT=YES.Volume
:LISTCOL VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=21.Device
:LISTCOL VAR=VOLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=33.Volume Type
:LISTCOL VAR=MEDTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=47.Media Type
:LISTCOL VAR=AUTL USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=57.Authorization List
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPTAP.Display Tape Volume Information - Help
:P.The labels of the volume in the tape device: its identifier, owner
and code, and each file's sequence number, label, dates and size.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPTAPSAV.Display Tape Save Information - Help
:P.The objects each save file on the volume holds, by file sequence.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPTAPCTG.Display Tape Cartridge - Help
:P.One cartridge of a media library: its volume, category and where it
is now. Enter shows the next cartridge that matched.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPOPT.Display Optical - Help
:P.An optical volume: its attributes, its directories, its files, or the
objects its save files hold, as DATA asked.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKOPTVOL.Work with Optical Volumes - Help
:P.The optical volumes in the system's optical devices. Type the device
to show only its volumes; 5 shows a volume, 8 its directories.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave; F5 reads the volumes again.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKIMGCLG.Work with Image Catalogs - Help
:P.Each image catalog is a directory of virtual optical images or virtual
tape volumes. Load one on a virtual device to use its volumes; F11
switches between the status columns and the catalogs' texts.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKIMGCLGE.Work with Image Catalog Entries - Help
:P.The volumes of one catalog. A loaded entry is in the device; the
mounted one is the volume the device presents. Option 1 on the first
line adds an image at the index typed there; F6 loads or unloads the
catalog.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKTAPCTG.Work with Tape Cartridges - Help
:P.The cartridges a media library holds. New ones arrive in *INSERT;
add them to a category before use. Mount moves a cartridge into a drive,
demount sends it back to its slot, remove ejects it to a station.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKMLBSTS.Work with Media Library Status - Help
:P.Each media library and its drives. An allocated drive is held by this
system, an unprotected one is used when needed, a deallocated one never.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
